---
description: Git commits without Cursor co-author trailers
alwaysApply: true
---

When creating git commits in this project:

- Never pass `git commit --trailer "Co-authored-by: Cursor ..."` or any Co-authored-by / Made-with Cursor trailer.
- Use plain `git commit -m "..."` (or HEREDOC) with message body only.
- Do not amend solely to add agent attribution.
